cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "agentic-perimeter: Passive External Agentic Exposure & Brand Provenance Scanner"
message: "If you use this software or the anonymized State of External Agentic Exposure 2027 datasets in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Techio
    given-names: "Jônadas"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jonadas-tech/agentic-perimeter"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/agentic-perimeter/"
abstract: >-
  Open-source, 100% passive External Attack Surface Management (EASM) CLI and
  MCP server auditing cross-registry MCP supply-chain provenance (Official MCP
  Registry, npm, PyPI, GitHub), unverified third-party hosted proxies, wire-level
  IETF DNS-AID (draft-02), DNSSEC, DANE TLSA, OWASP ANS v2 host binding, and
  RFC 9728 OAuth Protected Resource metadata, accompanied by an anonymized
  empirical study across 100 public brands and 632 unverified npm/PyPI MCP packages.
keywords:
  - mcp
  - model-context-protocol
  - agentic-ai
  - cybersecurity
  - owasp
  - dns-aid
  - dnssec
  - supply-chain-security
  - oauth
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.3.1"
date-released: "2026-11-25"
